title: "Analysis data for: Bundibugyo virus carries a genus-exclusive four-position VP24 configuration that orders cell-type interferon restriction"
abstract: >-
  Source data for every figure, primary sequence and structural evidence,
  host reference tables, external dataset registrations, and the analysis
  code that generates every number reported in the associated manuscript.
  Third-party raw data are not redistributed; they are identified by
  repository accession and retrieval date.
